flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0911162Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0911984Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0913521Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0914015Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0914432Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0915949Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0916539Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0916943Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0917696Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0918045Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0918719Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0919673Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0920522Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0921163Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0921468Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0921793Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0922291Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0922916Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0923532Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0923692Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0923809Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0923999Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0927419Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
