flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0929373Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0929653Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0929974Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0930708Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0931502Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
