flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0932900Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T14:46:31.0933219Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
